      "writtenOn": "2021-09-08T13:41:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Normally we install platform files in /system, and apex files in /apex, so this case is different (we install apex files in /system).\n\nBut you are right that it would still be a problem to create an `android.InstallPath` path in /system/framework even for a platform jar, due to `validateSafePath` restrictions.  Normally we would just handle install paths that are written to makefiles as strings, not as `android.InstallPath`.\n\nSo perhaps it is better to use a string for install path instead of this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "68c7aa1f_f3cbbce7",
      "revId": "6f7e3804ea3517b4d78475738ccc7a646ff50757",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
